    "text": "‘Powerful’ Wester Disturbance, ‘U-shaped jet streams’\nWeather experts described the disturbance as powerful, with its “U-shaped” jet streams set to bring hailstorms along with rain in parts of the country. Rain and hailstorms did lash several places in Haryana and Punjab on Tuesday, raising worries among wheat growers, who anticipated damage to their crop which was ready for harvesting.",
